  "answer": "**Starter (SMB) plan:** The evidence does not provide an explicit onboarding guidance timeline for the Starter plan. Actual SMB/Starter onboarding duration was a median of **3.5 weeks** in Q2 [NL-012#NL-012-S06], confirmed by the sample average of `(3.2 + 3.8) / 2 = 3.5` weeks [NL-031#NL-031-S03]. A separate Q1 report lists SMB average onboarding at **3.6 weeks** [NL-010#NL-010-S02].\n\n**Growth (Mid-Market) plan:** Documented guidance says Growth Plan onboarding is **4–6 weeks** [NL-005#NL-005-S02]. Actual Mid-Market/Growth average onboarding was **5.2 weeks** in Q2 [NL-012#NL-012-S06], confirmed by the sample average of `(4.2 + 5.4 + 6.0) / 3 = 5.2` weeks [NL-031#NL-031-S03]. A separate Q1 report lists Mid-Market average onboarding at **5.4 weeks** [NL-010#NL-010-S02].\n\n**Comparison:** Growth actual onboarding (5.2–5.4 weeks) falls within the documented 4–6 week Growth guidance. Starter actual onboarding (3.5–3.6 weeks) is faster than Growth actual, but there is no supplied Starter guidance timeline to compare against, so Starter guidance vs. actual cannot be fully evaluated from the evidence.\n\nANSWER_STATUS: answer  \nUSED_MEMORY_CLAIMS: none",
